  "findings": [
    "run_task adds a strict bool prepare_continuation=True. Existing callers preserve eager preparation; only the Stage05 NO_E scenario explicitly passes False after ordinary cold Work. No source TTL, temporal minimum, native API, SAVE authority or current-source check is relaxed.",
    "The experience command binds active_step=STAGE05_EXPERIENCE around the whole scenario and restores it in finally. Actual role-call count remains None until measured from the completed cold snapshot.",
    "The Stage05 clock is selected only for inherited non-owner-scenario launch paths whose canonical hash, schema, source-review ref, first-process identity and inherited clocks match. Other paths retain the exact pinned legacy timer.",
    "Supervisor adds only the reviewed closed checkpoint/phase display hook and corresponding banner; timing predicates, cleanup, lock ownership and dispatch are unchanged.",
    "Fresh operation/native limits become 3000/900 seconds and the isolated engineering ceiling 900 seconds. The measured 300-second native prefix proves the earlier cap inadequate; remaining 72 source reads/23 quanta are static counts, not a measured speed or completion estimate. The new cap is a bounded measurement allowance.",
    "The G3 change is only a docstring correction. G4 performs explicit current-history checks at its defined boundaries and final acceptance, not before every pure quantum. Retained historical review is corrected append-only.",
    "Only three exact diagnostic codes are added; projector membership/sanitization behavior remains unchanged."
  ],
